    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tibor is a poor young painter who is in love with beautiful Agnes. But fate decides to separate them! The evil countess turns Tibor into a vampire! Only, Tibor is an unique vampire - a kind one! A vampire whose love for Agnes is stronger than any other force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.poster.avif?t=1734948256\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.webm?t=1734948256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.mp4?t=1734948256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tibor return to Agnes and defeat the evil countess and her vampire army! Play through dozens of exciting and rich levels, discover tons of secret locations, collect coins, diamonds and potions, all while enjoying beautiful landscapes in this fun platformer game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/7a81ee3039923cf539649dd1fd8ba88b.avif?t=1734948256\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will appeal to both children and adults; it's just fun to jump around, discover new places, overcome obstacles and collect coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BASED on the popular Croatian fairy tale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO VIOLENCE; makes it perfect for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER 5 different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOZENS of huge levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND many secret places and BONUS levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLECT coins, diamonds, potions and other treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEAUTIFUL 4K ultra HD graphics</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tibor is a poor young painter who is in love with beautiful Agnes. But fate decides to separate them! The evil countess turns Tibor into a vampire! Only, Tibor is an unique vampire - a kind one! A vampire whose love for Agnes is stronger than any other force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.poster.avif?t=1734948256\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.webm?t=1734948256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/5708913c17f9c7040d4b04322f52fc23.mp4?t=1734948256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Tibor return to Agnes and defeat the evil countess and her vampire army! Play through dozens of exciting and rich levels, discover tons of secret locations, collect coins, diamonds and potions, all while enjoying beautiful landscapes in this fun platformer game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285420/extras/7a81ee3039923cf539649dd1fd8ba88b.avif?t=1734948256\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will appeal to both children and adults; it's just fun to jump around, discover new places, overcome obstacles and collect coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BASED on the popular Croatian fairy tale</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NO VIOLENCE; makes it perfect for all ages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER 5 different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DOZENS of huge levels to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND many secret places and BONUS levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLLECT coins, diamonds, potions and other treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEAUTIFUL 4K ultra HD graphics</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Help Tibor save his beloved one and their village from the evil Countess and her vampire army! Based on a popular Croatian fairy-tale book, this warm and inviting jump n' run platformer game will provide hours and hours of fun to both grownups and kids.",
